WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Despite the success that you're having,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.070
and you're getting more
and more well-known,

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.320
that you still get
mistaken for other actors.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.870
Is that right?
Yeah, yeah I do.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.820
Chelsea Peretti is someone
people always think I am,

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.570
on Brooklyn Nine-Nine, and Kristen Schaal.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.003
And I also get DJ Qualls all the time.

00:00:15.003 --> 00:00:16.035
[Conan] What?

00:00:16.035 --> 00:00:17.210
(audience laughs)

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.043
Just like everyday.

00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:19.090
We have pictures of
some of these people up

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.710
that you get mistaken for.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.970
You don't look like,
there's you on the top left,

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.270
you don't look like, you
know, that's not right.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:26.890
[Lauren] Oh yeah, the
girl from Spider Man,

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.770
Regina Topa, yeah.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.330
But people think I'm, I mean
they don't think I'm him,

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.130
but they write to me everyday and tell me

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.480
that we're siblings or something.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.509
He's great, I just, I like to be myself.

00:00:37.509 --> 00:00:38.490
(laughs)

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.050
You're so much taller in-person.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.050
Do you get that a lot from people?

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.264
Yeah, people are really surprised.

00:00:42.264 --> 00:00:43.400
They think I'm gonna be tiny.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.540
Yeah, people that see you
on Orange is the New Black,

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.440
and they think, okay, I get that too.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:50.697
Anywhere I go places, people think,

00:00:50.697 --> 00:00:52.307
"Okay, I thought you might be kinda tall,

00:00:52.307 --> 00:00:54.820
"but not that tall", and I was surprised,

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.480
I finally get to say it to someone else.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:57.860
You are so much taller than I thought.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:58.713
Yeah, you too.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.513
(audience laughs)

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.540
You turned it back on me.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.820
The whole point.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.893
I think you both look like DJ Qualls.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.180
So there.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.253
You got us.

